  "description": "***EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY PLEASE***APOLOGIES WE MAY NOT BE IN A POSITION TO RESPOND TO ALL ENQUIRIES***Olivers Estate Agents are delighted to present this bright and spacious ground-floor apartment situated in the popular and exceptionally well-maintained Eden Gate development in Delgany.\nThe property offers two generous double bedrooms, with the master bedroom benefiting from an en-suite. There is a bright and welcoming open-plan sitting and dining area, with the kitchen conveniently located just off the main living space. The living room opens directly onto a private patio, providing a lovely outdoor space to relax or enjoy al fresco dining. The property also benefits from parking.\nEden Gate is ideally located, with a selection of convenient amenities situated at the entrance to the development, including local shops, café and other everyday services. The property is also within easy reach of the wider amenities of Delgany and Greystones, including supermarkets, boutiques, restaurants, schools, sporting facilities and leisure activities. The area offers beautiful walks and easy access to the coast and nearby beaches.\nThe development is particularly well connected for commuters, with bus stops just a few minutes' walk away, including the L2, L3, X1 and X2 services, providing convenient connections to Greystones, Bray, surrounding areas and Dublin City Centre.\nFor those travelling by car, Eden Gate is conveniently located for the N11/M11, providing easy access to the M50, Dublin City Centre, Dublin Airport and the wider motorway network.\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate all that this lovely apartment and its location have to offer.",
